anslation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我看人生就像摇摆的藤蔓</span></p><p begin="40.527" end="42.132" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="40.527" end="40.670">Swing</span> <span begin="40.670" end="40.942">my</span> <span begin="40.942" end="41.400">heart</span> <span begin="41.400" end="41.670">across</span> <span begin="41.670" end="41.840">the</span> <span begin="41.840" end="42.132">line</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">动摇我的内心跨过这道线</span></p><p begin="42.390" end="44.361" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.390" end="42.590">In</span> <span begin="42.590" end="42.870">my</span> <span begin="42.870" end="43.239">face</span> <span begin="43.239" end="43.416">is</span> <span begin="43.416" end="43.822">flashing</span> <span begin="43.822" end="44.361">signs</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的脸就像那闪烁符号</span></p><p begin="44.550" end="46.099" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.550" end="44.720">Seek</span> <span begin="44.720" end="44.870">it</span> <span begin="44.870" end="45.102">out</span> <span begin="45.102" end="45.371">and</span> <span begin="45.371" end="45.560">you</span> <span begin="45.560" end="45.862">shall</span> <span begin="45.862" end="46.099">find</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">搜寻 而你找到了</span></p><p begin="46.302" end="48.086" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="46.302" end="46.742">Old,</span> <span begin="47.030" end="47.182">but</span> <span begin="47.182" end="47.350">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="47.350" end="47.550">not</span> <span begin="47.550" end="47.811">that</span> <span begin="47.811" end="48.086">old</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我没那么老</span></p><p begin="48.251" end="50.024" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.251" end="48.742">Young,</span> <span begin="49.011" end="49.182">but</span> <span begin="49.182" end="49.320">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="49.320" end="49.531">not</span> <span begin="49.531" end="49.790">that</span> <span begin="49.790" end="50.024">bold</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">年轻 但我没那么英勇无谓</span></p><p begin="50.291" end="52.240" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="50.291" end="50.542">I</span> <span begin="50.542" end="50.800">don&apos;t</span> <span begin="50.800" end="51.000">think</span> <span begin="51.000" end="51.222">the</span> <span begin="51.222" end="51.440">world</span> <span begin="51.440" end="51.670">is</span> <span begin="51.670" end="52.240">sold</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不认为这是个被出卖的世界</span></p><p begin="52.363" end="54.093" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="52.363" end="52.533">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="52.533" end="52.723">just</span> <span begin="52.723" end="53.093">doing</span> <span begin="53.093" end="53.392">what</span> <span begin="53.392" end="53.661">we&apos;re</span> <span begin="53.661" end="54.093">told</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我只是循规蹈矩地生活着</span></p><p begin="54.680" end="58.590" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.680" end="56.662">I</span> <span begin="56.662" end="57.120">feel</span> <span begin="57.120" end="57.640">something</span> <span begin="57.640" end="58.131">so</span> <span begin="58.131" end="58.590">right</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">体味心安理得</span></p><p begin="59.160" end="1:01.491" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="59.160" end="59.622">Doing</span> <span begin="59.622" end="59.851">the</span> <span begin="59.851" end="1:00.291">wrong</span> <span begin="1:00.291" end="1:01.491">thing</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">惯于离经叛道中</span></p><p begin="1:02.542" end="1:06.451" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.542" end="1:04.542">I</span> <span begin="1:04.542" end="1:05.000">feel</span> <span begin="1:05.000" end="1:05.510">something</span> <span begin="1:05.510" end="1:05.990">so</span> <span begin="1:05.990" end="1: